## Scenarios

### Ed25519 RFC 8032 §7.1 test vectors

#### T1: derived public key matches RFC 8032 §7.1 vector

- Verify: T1: derived public key matches RFC 8032 §7.1 vector
   - Expected: kp.1 equals `PUB_T1`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: T1: derived public key matches RFC 8032 §7.1 vector")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val kp = ed25519_keypair_from_seed(SEED_T1)
expect(kp.1).to_equal(PUB_T1)
```

</details>

#### T1: sign(empty) byte-matches RFC 8032 §7.1 expected signature

- Verify: T1: sign(empty) byte-matches RFC 8032 §7.1 expected signature
   - Expected: sig equals `SIG_T1`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: T1: sign(empty) byte-matches RFC 8032 §7.1 expected signature")
val kp = ed25519_keypair_from_seed(SEED_T1)
val sig = ed25519_sign(kp.0, kp.1, [])
expect(sig).to_equal(SIG_T1)
```

</details>

